00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 10.8 · Legal, Compliance, Policies & Risk
HR and workplace policies

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
As soon as anyone helps, even one volunteer, you need some workplace policies.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Give volunteers role descriptions, expenses and supervision.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Decide what is needed now and what waits for the first hire.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Check each policy with a local employment adviser.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You list the HR policies you will need, their triggers and status.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
